{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heatwave is a <strong>2d fighting game</strong> and <strong>visual novel</strong>, set many years after apocalyptic heatwaves have made most of the Earth uninhabitable. Now, humanity is split between Earth, the Moon, and the Underworld...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of 15+ unique fighters in classic game modes, such as Arcade, Survival, Local Vs, Combo Trial, and more! Then, discover their stories through a 42 chapter <strong>visual novel story mode!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980420/extras/bb220d437f9044af0896ac3ca2994fff.avif?t=1764563607\" width=470 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose between 3 unique fighting styles, which drastically change how the game plays!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Speed Mode:</strong> A fast, movement and combo based fighting mode, geared towards beginners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Mode:</strong>  Limited movement and cancels, but a stronger parry, higher damage, and special overdrive state to compensate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Team Mode:</strong> Instead of an assist, pick a second character to fight alongside, and gain access to powerful setups and pressure by switching places with them. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980420/extras/b064b581aa7e9294a79b20b7c8318a29.avif?t=1764563607\" width=470 height=90 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Did you get a good score?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980420/547dc149b9a0f17772a4c354db4f77c1ea47ab72.jpg"},{"name":"Apocalypse Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980420/7ec9f4118fee4e84fccae73d9c11f916b20730ee.jpg"},{"name":"Arcade Mode Addict","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980420/2745afeffa137df8a58dc38daa84e10f4d4ff716.jpg"},{"name":"Now do them in a real match!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980420/b0b1535ad60b23e89b9804fa0b21f2f00e388443.jpg"},{"name":"All Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980420/7c9f471d742eaf0cc189cd98ceb1d4bcff2e7956.jpg"},{"name":"Learning to Read","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980420/32e6a38f0862e9a2df1dbe1733784732905dcc97.jpg"},{"name":"I Love Women with Swords","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980420/1504392c90ef202d773ed5950af140b462d30ef2.jpg"},{"name":"Exorcism","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980420/8585c540491e21bd65af45ecc93631c234fff968.jpg"},{"name":"Revenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980420/32214313ab678bc497206e9895adeb5a33fea961.jpg"},{"name":"Immigration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980420/78946221621fbedbd9a34a272d2dc1fdc6da20eb.jpg"}],"total":33},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2980420?t=1764563607","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2980420?t=1764563607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980420/4e1934d40236c0c61ae741843a9f138e0cab4ea9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764563607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980420/4e1934d40236c0c61ae741843a9f138e0cab4ea9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764563607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":